---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { siteConfig } from '../data/site';

const pageTitle = 'Privacy Policy | North Star Digital';
const description = 'Privacy policy for northstardigital.services — how we collect, use, and protect your information.';
const updated = 'June 16, 2026';
---

<BaseLayout title={pageTitle} description={description} path="/privacy">

  <section class="bg-[#0B2545] px-4 py-14 md:py-16">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white md:text-4xl">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-[#8EA8C3]">Last updated: {updated}</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="px-4 py-16 md:py-20">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl prose prose-lg max-w-none text-[#304059]
      prose-headings:text-[#0B2545] prose-headings:font-bold
      prose-h2:text-xl prose-h2:mt-10 prose-h2:mb-3
      prose-p:leading-relaxed prose-p:mb-4 prose-p:text-[#44506A]
      prose-a:text-[#2E8BFF] hover:prose-a:underline
      prose-strong:text-[#0B2545]
      prose-ul:my-3 prose-li:text-[#44506A]">

      <p>North Star Digital LLC ("we," "us," or "our") operates <strong>northstardigital.services</strong>. This page explains what information we collect when you use our website, how we use it, and your rights.</p>

      ## Information We Collect

      **Information you give us directly:**
      When you fill out the contact form on our website, we collect your name, business name, phone number, email address, and the message you send. This information is processed by Formspree and forwarded to our email.

      **Information collected automatically:**
      We use Google Analytics (GA4) to understand how visitors use our site. This includes your approximate location (city/region), device type, browser, pages visited, and time on site. Google Analytics uses cookies. No personally identifiable information is collected through analytics unless you submit a form.

      **Cookies:**
      Our site uses cookies for Google Analytics. You can disable cookies in your browser settings at any time. We do not use tracking cookies for advertising purposes.

      ## How We Use Your Information

      - To respond to your inquiry or consultation request
      - To understand which pages and content are most useful to visitors
      - To improve our website and services

      We do not sell, rent, or share your personal information with third parties for marketing purposes.

      ## Third-Party Services

      We use the following third-party services that may process your data:

      - **Google Analytics** — website traffic analysis (Google Privacy Policy: policies.google.com/privacy)
      - **Formspree** — contact form processing (Formspree Privacy Policy: formspree.io/legal/privacy-policy)
      - **Calendly** — appointment scheduling, if you use our booking link (Calendly Privacy Policy: calendly.com/privacy)

      Each of these services has its own privacy policy governing their use of your data.

      ## Data Retention

      We retain contact form submissions as long as needed to respond to your inquiry and for reasonable business record-keeping. You can request deletion of your data at any time by emailing us.

      ## Your Rights

      You have the right to:
      - Request a copy of the personal information we hold about you
      - Request correction of inaccurate information
      - Request deletion of your information
      - Opt out of Google Analytics tracking (use the Google Analytics opt-out browser add-on at tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout)

      ## Contact Us

      If you have questions about this policy or want to exercise your rights, contact us at:

      **North Star Digital LLC**
      Waukesha, Wisconsin
      Email: {siteConfig.email}
      Phone: {siteConfig.phone}

      ## Changes to This Policy

      We may update this policy from time to time. Changes will be posted on this page with an updated date. Continued use of our website after changes constitutes acceptance of the updated policy.

    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>
